  <description>
    <contents xml:lang="en">
      <p>
        This coffin belonged to a woman who was buried near the city of Akhmim in the Ptolemaic period. Her coffin, as well as her mummy and cartonnage mummy-trappings were purchased on the antiquities market by George Reisner, for the growing Egyptian collection of Phoebe Hearst. 
      </p>
    </contents>
  </description>
  <texts>
    <text id = "text1">
      <desc>
        Panel on Lower Legs,  Columns read from viewer right to left.
      </desc>
      <frag id="text1col1">
        <himg src="${assets}/yasmin/texts/text_1_col_1.svg" dest="img/yasmin_text1col1.svg"/>
        <hi encoding="mdc-jsesh"></hi> 
        <al encoding="mdc">
          Dd md.w (i)n wsir xnty {imn.tyw} tA.wy n x.t   
        </al>
        <tr xml:lang="en">
          Recitation by Osiris, foremost (of the westerners): The two lands are ready for the measuring-stick, the White Crown...   
        </tr>
      </frag>
      <frag id="text1col2">
        <himg src="${assets}/yasmin/texts/text_1_col_2.svg" dest="img/yasmin_text1col2.svg"/>
        <al encoding="mdc">
          n tw.t iAt n wsir-wnn-nfr   
        </al>
        <tr xml:lang="en">
          ...is ready for the statue. The standard is ready for Osiris-Wenennefer.   
        </tr>
      </frag>
      <frag id="text1col3">
        <himg src="${assets}/yasmin/texts/text_1_col_3.svg" dest="img/yasmin_text1col3.svg"/>
        <al encoding="mdc">
          ink pw Xrd sp-fd i ib     
        </al>
        <tr xml:lang="en">
          I am a child! (x4) Oh, kid...   
        </tr>
      </frag>
      <frag id="text1col4">
        <himg src="${assets}/yasmin/texts/text_1_col_4.svg" dest="img/yasmin_text1col4.svg"/>
        <al encoding="mdc">
          wr iw Dd=k n min apr  
        </al>
        <tr xml:lang="en">
          ...of the Great One, you said today: "Equip...   
        </tr>
      </frag>
      <frag id="text1col5">
        <himg src="${assets}/yasmin/texts/text_1_col_5.svg" dest="img/yasmin_text1col5.svg"/>
        <al encoding="mdc">
          nm.t m rx{r}.n(=k) i(i)=k r=s m   
        </al>
        <tr xml:lang="en">
          ...the slaughter-house with what you have learned when you arrive to it as...   
        </tr>
      </frag>
      <frag id="text1col6">
        <himg src="${assets}/yasmin/texts/text_1_col_6.svg" dest="img/yasmin_text1col6.svg"/>
        <al encoding="mdc">
          is(f) wr ink ra smn n Hs.(wt) D.t   
        </al>
        <tr xml:lang="en">
          ...The Marrow of the Great One. I am Re, established of praise, forever!   
        </tr>
      </frag>
    </text>
    <text id="text2">
      <desc>Bottom of Feet</desc>
      <himg src="${assets}/yasmin/texts/text_2.svg" dest="img/yasmin_text2.svg"/>
      <al encoding="mdc">
          nb.t-Hw.t   
      </al>
      <tr xml:lang="en">
        Nepthys   
      </tr>
    </text>
    <text id="text3">
      <desc>Bottom of Feet</desc>
