      </tr>
    </text>
    <text id="text6">
      <desc>Top of Head</desc>
      <himg src="${assets}/yasmin/texts/text_6.svg" dest="img/yasmin_text6.svg"/>
      <al encoding="mdc">
        Hw.t-Hr imn.t   
      </al>
      <tr xml:lang="en">
        Hathor of the West   
      </tr>
    </text>
    <text id="text7">
      <desc>Long vertical inscription on edge of basin, viewer lef</desc>
      <himg src="${assets}/yasmin/texts/text_7.svg" dest="img/yasmin_text7.svg"/>
      <al encoding="mdc">
        Dd md.w (i)n wsir xnty-imnty.w nTr aA nb AbDw ptH-zqr{k}-wsir nTr aA Hry-ib qrs As.t-wr.t mw.t nTr nb.t-Hw.t sn.t nTr   
      </al>
      <tr xml:lang="en">
        Recitation by Osiris, foremost of the westerners, the great god, lord of Abydos, and Ptah-Sokar-Osiris,    
        the great god, one who is in the tomb, and Isis the Great, mother of the god, and Nepthys, sister of the God   
        and Imsety, Hapy, and Duamutef: "Forever".   
      </tr>
    </text>
    <text id="text8">
      <desc>Long vertical inscription on the edge of basin, viewer right.</desc>
      <himg src="${assets}/yasmin/texts/text_8.svg" dest="img/yasmin_text8.svg"/>
      <al encoding="mdc">
        Dd md.w (i)n wsir xnty-imnty.w nTr aA nb AbDw ptH-zqr{k}-wsir nTr aA Hry-ib qrs As.t-wr.t mw.t nTr nb.t-Hw.t sn.t nTr   
      </al>
      <tr xml:lang="en">
        Recitation by Osiris foremost of the Westerners, great god, lord of Abydos, and Ptah-Sokar-Osiris,    
        great god, one who is in the tomb, and Isis the Great, mother of the god, and Nepthys, sisters of the god,   
        and Anubis, lord of the two holy lands, and Anubis who oversees the Divine Pavillion: "Making protection for Osiris Forever".   
      </tr>
    </text> 
        <text id="text9">
      <desc>Above image of goddess Nut, on her head.</desc>
      <himg src="${assets}/yasmin/texts/text_9.svg" dest="img/yasmin_text9.svg"/>
      <al encoding="mdc">
       nw.t
      </al>
      <tr xml:lang="en">
        Nut
      </tr>
    </text> 
